      "label": "class_d_05_poke_03",
      "hash64": "DCDE97CD94E732B6",
      "text": "Pikkaaa !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_15",
      "hash64": "6D3265ECA3C6045C",
      "text": "C’est pour exprimer sa colère ! On entend dans\\nsa voix à quel point il est énervé ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_16",
      "hash64": "6D3268ECA3C60975",
      "text": "Pour cette fois, bien sûr, j’ai demandé à mon\\ncher Pikachu de faire semblant d’être en colère.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_17",
      "hash64": "6D3267ECA3C607C2",
      "text": "Vous ne trouvez pas que son interprétation était\\nparfaite ? Allons, applaudissez-le ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_d_05_popup_01",
      "hash64": "B80FB7BCCDBC3AF3",
      "text": "*clap* *clap* *clap*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_18",
      "hash64": "6D326AECA3C60CDB",
      "text": "Bien entendu, les Pokémon sont capables de\\ndire plusieurs choses différentes.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_19",
      "hash64": "6D3269ECA3C60B28",
      "text": "Tout dépend de leur humeur et de leur état.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_20",
      "hash64": "6D27F0ECA3BCE908",
      "text": "Après le cours, essayez de bien écouter les cris\\nde vos Pokémon. Cela vous permettra de mieux\\r\\ncomprendre vos compagnons, vous verrez ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_21",
      "hash64": "6D27F1ECA3BCEABB",
      "text": "Quand j’y pense... Les Pokémon sont vraiment\\ndes créatures merveilleuses ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_22",
      "hash64": "6D27F2ECA3BCEC6E",
      "text": "Figurez-vous que certains ne crient pas pour\\ncommuniquer. Ils utilisent plutôt les ultrasons,\\r\\nles ondes électromagnétiques, ou encore\\r\\nla télépathie ! C’est vraiment bluffant ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_23",
      "hash64": "6D27F3ECA3BCEE21",
      "text": "Vous l’attendiez, non ? Voici le conseil salvateur\\nde Salvio ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "class_d_05_language_24",
      "hash64": "6D27F4ECA3BCEFD4",
      "text": "Lorsque vous faites un pique-nique, ne soyez\\npas trop taquins avec vos Pokémon pendant\\r\\nle Poké Toilettage.\\c\\nÇa risquerait de les énerver, comme Pikachu\\nnous l’a montré ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
